1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,060
Twine taken from one boy. 13 pupils.
A school coming apart.

2
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,660
Nebraska, 1888.

3
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:10,500
The door blew in, then the windows.

4
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:13,320
Minnie Freeman knew the building wouldn't last.

5
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:16,380
The nearest house was three quarters of a mile away.

6
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:20,080
She remembered the twine she'd taken
from a boy playing in class.

7
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,740
She tied the pupils together and waited.

8
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:25,160
Only then did the roof blow away.

9
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:28,340
Carrying the youngest, she led them
through the blizzard.

10
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,120
Freeman later said she nearly lost hope.

11
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,500
All 13 reached the farmhouse, connected by—
